= Credits

*Conservatism: An Alternate History* is a total-conversion mod of {!<a href="https://github.com/aucchen/social_democracy_alternate_history">Social Democracy: An Alternate History</a>!} by Autumn Chen, used under the MIT License.

Built with {!<a href="https://github.com/aucchen/dendrynexus">dendrynexus</a>!}, Autumn Chen's fork of Ian Millington's Dendry interactive fiction engine.

Libraries: jQuery, d3.js and d3-parliament.

This is a work of alternate-history fiction. The real people who appear in it are portrayed in their public, historical roles.

